# Production build target for admin.minitv.us (static R2 site behind Cloudflare,
# no server-side proxy for /admin/v1/*). Committed on purpose: without it the
# build emits same-origin /admin/v1 calls that the CDN answers with a
# Cloudflare "Unauthorized" page, so the console can never log in.
# An inline shell variable (VITE_API_BASE=...) still overrides this.
VITE_API_BASE=https://api.minitv.us
